WEBVTT

00:07.424 --> 00:09.426
[opening theme music playing]

00:12.220 --> 00:14.222
[wind gusting]

00:37.746 --> 00:41.875
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE 2

00:44.085 --> 00:46.212
[ominous music playing]

00:46.296 --> 00:48.298
[Ho-jae breathing heavily]

00:50.467 --> 00:51.885
[Ho-jae] What is this place?

00:53.928 --> 00:56.639
[man 1] Please? Let me out of here!

00:56.723 --> 00:57.724
[woman 1] Somebody!

00:58.224 --> 01:00.393
- Help us!
- [woman 2] Help us!

01:00.477 --> 01:02.562
- [man 2] Please. Please!
- [people sobbing]

01:03.313 --> 01:05.065
- [man 2] Please help us!
- [man 1] Help!

01:05.148 --> 01:06.649
I don't wanna die.

01:06.733 --> 01:08.109
Help! Anybody!

01:08.985 --> 01:10.236
I don't wanna die!

01:11.029 --> 01:12.655
[Chae-ok] Don't come any closer.

01:13.406 --> 01:15.492
[panting]

01:16.201 --> 01:19.079
I could actually attack you
if you don't run away.

01:19.162 --> 01:21.206
[Ho-jae] How is it that you're alive?

01:21.289 --> 01:22.874
You need to stay away from me.

01:23.750 --> 01:24.751
Go away!

01:24.834 --> 01:26.419
[dramatic music playing]

01:28.088 --> 01:30.090
[tentacles squelching]

01:36.805 --> 01:38.473
- [Mrs. Nawol] Tae-sang!
- [gasping]

01:41.142 --> 01:43.561
[distant sirens wailing]

01:45.105 --> 01:45.939
[sighs]

01:49.776 --> 01:50.777
[door opens]

01:56.783 --> 01:58.034
[Ji-su] You're finally awake.

01:59.619 --> 02:00.787
What's with the handcuffs?

02:02.038 --> 02:04.165
First, I'd like to know
what happened yesterday.

02:05.125 --> 02:06.918
Tell me who you met at the old factory.

02:12.298 --> 02:13.633
Where is everyone?

02:14.801 --> 02:16.761
I would like to speak with Yong-gil.

02:16.845 --> 02:19.305
[Ji-su] Mr. Kwon is currently
in critical condition.

02:21.391 --> 02:24.769
He sustained severe injuries to his head,
which led to cerebral hemorrhaging.

02:24.853 --> 02:27.772
He received emergency surgery
and is currently in the ICU.

02:28.273 --> 02:29.858
[uneasy music playing]

02:29.941 --> 02:31.359
Where's the ICU wing?

02:32.110 --> 02:34.070
I have to see how he's doing.
Take these off.

02:34.154 --> 02:35.363
And why would I do that?

02:35.446 --> 02:38.783
I just told you I wanna see
how he's doing, so remove these now!

02:40.827 --> 02:41.870
Uncuff me.

02:42.579 --> 02:44.247
Listen, I am his guardian, all right?

02:44.330 --> 02:47.750
Our investigation team found a weapon
at the crime scene last night.

02:48.334 --> 02:50.837
There were traces of two people
on that weapon.

02:51.421 --> 02:54.340
Hair and blood
belonging to your friend Mr. Kwon

02:54.424 --> 02:56.759
along with your fingerprints, Mr. Jang.

02:58.178 --> 02:59.304
What are you trying to imply?

02:59.387 --> 03:01.681
It means that you two
were the only ones at the scene,

03:01.764 --> 03:03.850
and based on evidence we've got,

03:03.933 --> 03:07.395
there's actually quite a lot to suggest
it was you that attacked your friend.

03:07.478 --> 03:08.605
So why would you do that?

03:08.688 --> 03:10.523
What? I would never attack Yong-gil!

03:13.193 --> 03:15.278
He's my best friend. Why would I do that?

03:15.361 --> 03:16.905
Was it because of money?

03:16.988 --> 03:17.822
Money?

03:17.906 --> 03:20.325
I've recently heard
Bugang Company is in debt.

03:20.408 --> 03:21.993
So how about we begin from there?

03:22.076 --> 03:23.328
You have some nerve, Detective.

03:23.411 --> 03:25.830
[Ji-su] Who, exactly,
was the woman that was with you?

03:25.914 --> 03:27.207
What's her part in this?

03:28.374 --> 03:31.794
Tell me, is she the one
who killed Madam Na and Mr. Oh Ki-hoon?

03:34.839 --> 03:35.673
No, she isn't.

03:35.757 --> 03:38.635
If the woman was with you, she must be
connected to the serial killer.

03:38.718 --> 03:40.762
She's not connected at all,
I'm telling you!

03:40.845 --> 03:44.098
Then how about you tell me what happened
because nothing is adding up.

03:46.517 --> 03:47.644
[Ho-jae] Yoon Chae-ok.

03:50.730 --> 03:51.564
[clattering]

03:53.816 --> 03:54.651
[Chae-ok] No!

03:55.276 --> 03:57.070
Can you hear me? [whimpers]

03:57.153 --> 03:58.529
Stay with me, okay?

03:59.822 --> 04:01.324
Wake up! Don't fall asleep!

04:02.200 --> 04:04.035
No! No!

04:04.118 --> 04:06.120
[stirring music playing]

04:13.419 --> 04:17.340
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE
BETWEEN A PRETENSE OF VIRTUE AND VICE

04:17.423 --> 04:21.052
EPISODE 4
THE OTHER SIDE

04:21.636 --> 04:22.971
[chimes ringing]

04:23.054 --> 04:24.973
[elderly woman] Is it consciousness

04:25.598 --> 04:29.143
or the subconscious
that rules over a person?

04:30.228 --> 04:32.272
[ringing]

04:34.232 --> 04:36.234
[pensive music playing]

04:38.945 --> 04:41.155
[elderly woman]
What is it that changes fate?

04:41.239 --> 04:43.199
Does it spontaneously occur

04:43.283 --> 04:46.327
in our daily routines
that we repeat over and over?

04:47.036 --> 04:49.205
Or is it an unforeseen coincidence

04:49.289 --> 04:51.207
that surfaces in hardship?

04:55.420 --> 04:57.297
What is it exactly

04:57.380 --> 05:00.133
that ultimately defines us as a person?

05:01.217 --> 05:02.719
Is it disposition?

05:03.928 --> 05:06.180
Or perhaps it is ability.

05:12.937 --> 05:17.317
Yes, well, would it not all depend
on the person in question?

05:17.400 --> 05:20.570
And why would it depend
on the person in question?

05:20.653 --> 05:23.698
Eh, we are all unique individuals.

05:23.781 --> 05:24.699
All different.

05:24.782 --> 05:27.702
And we each transform
in unpredictable ways.

05:27.785 --> 05:30.288
I argue it's not about differences

05:30.997 --> 05:32.707
but our imperfections.

05:33.583 --> 05:36.711
The real truth of the matter is that

05:36.794 --> 05:40.256
the majority of humans
are imperfect beings.

05:41.507 --> 05:43.926
They struggle between good and evil.

05:44.010 --> 05:47.764
That's why many
are meant to be led by someone.

05:47.847 --> 05:49.849
It may seem, at first,

05:50.350 --> 05:54.020
that humans are ceaselessly searching
for life's answers,

05:54.103 --> 05:55.855
yet, in actuality,

05:55.938 --> 05:58.316
they are perpetually attempting to resolve

05:58.399 --> 06:01.361
the anxiety that resides deep within them.

06:03.571 --> 06:06.115
Thus, a human being

06:06.616 --> 06:09.827
does not have the required capacity

06:09.911 --> 06:11.746
for good intentions.

06:13.664 --> 06:15.875
They make selfish decisions.

06:15.958 --> 06:17.418
The choices they make

06:17.502 --> 06:19.670
are always for their own benefit.

06:20.838 --> 06:24.342
They only think of their survival
from beginning to end.

06:26.928 --> 06:31.099
So that is why
our work here is so significant.

06:31.641 --> 06:33.393
It's because we are leaders.

06:34.977 --> 06:37.230
It is also precisely the reason…

06:37.313 --> 06:38.523
[stirring string music playing]

06:38.606 --> 06:41.401
…that we need to continue gaining ground

06:41.484 --> 06:43.236
as we move forward

06:43.319 --> 06:45.405
and learn to evolve more quickly.

06:47.448 --> 06:50.868
We do not have the time to be wasting

06:51.577 --> 06:53.913
on any more failures at Jeonseung.

06:55.665 --> 06:56.874
I apologize.

06:57.375 --> 06:59.127
We'll continue to try harder.

07:00.044 --> 07:01.504
He has to return.

07:02.338 --> 07:05.299
Make sure you do
whatever it takes, Chairman Kato.

07:07.218 --> 07:10.012
Uh, but Lady Maeda,

07:10.805 --> 07:12.390
well, at this point, he's--

07:12.473 --> 07:14.267
He has to return.

07:18.271 --> 07:19.188
Yes.

07:29.782 --> 07:31.033
[chimes ringing]

07:41.961 --> 07:43.296
[car doors close]

07:43.379 --> 07:44.881
[music fades]

07:44.964 --> 07:46.674
[indistinct chattering]

07:55.391 --> 07:58.644
[phone buzzing]

08:00.313 --> 08:01.481
Mm, Detective.

08:02.315 --> 08:03.816
How's he doing? Any updates?

08:04.609 --> 08:06.319
[Ji-su] He's having a total breakdown.

08:06.819 --> 08:08.905
He demanded to see Kwon Yong-gil at first,

08:08.988 --> 08:12.450
but it seems he's out of it
and keeping quiet now.

08:12.533 --> 08:14.118
He's taking a nap, I think.

08:14.202 --> 08:15.411
[man 1] What'd the doctor say?

08:15.912 --> 08:17.246
His injuries aren't that severe,

08:17.330 --> 08:19.582
so the doctor says
he'll get discharged later today.

08:19.665 --> 08:22.710
Okay, get him discharged first,
then head over to the police station.

08:22.793 --> 08:24.170
I have a lot of questions for him.

08:24.795 --> 08:26.130
Yes, sir. I'll do that.

08:27.924 --> 08:28.883
[disconnect tone]

08:32.803 --> 08:35.473
Hello, is there any way for Jang Ho-jae
to get discharged sooner?

08:35.556 --> 08:37.934
Give me a minute.
Let me confirm with the doctor first.

08:38.017 --> 08:39.310
[phone clatters]

08:46.734 --> 08:47.652
[sighs]

08:57.203 --> 08:58.913
[stirring music playing]

09:04.961 --> 09:05.836
Sh.

09:06.837 --> 09:07.880
Be quiet.

09:09.423 --> 09:10.508
I'm gonna let you go.

09:19.100 --> 09:20.560
[man 1] How is this possible?

09:36.200 --> 09:38.202
- [sighs]
- [stirring music continues]

09:44.041 --> 09:44.875
[sighs]

09:48.296 --> 09:50.006
We're about done
searching outside, Captain.

09:50.089 --> 09:51.507
We found nothing significant.

09:51.591 --> 09:53.384
- What are you doing?
- Give me a hand with this.

09:55.720 --> 09:57.388
Okay, I got it. Thanks.

09:57.930 --> 09:58.806
[sighs]

10:00.308 --> 10:01.392
"Nitrogen."

10:01.976 --> 10:03.394
What is this for?

10:05.896 --> 10:08.149
It says "Jeonseung Bio."

10:08.774 --> 10:09.609
It's that laboratory.

10:09.692 --> 10:11.444
- Are you sure?
- Yes, sir.

10:14.238 --> 10:15.781
All right, let's get outta here.

10:15.865 --> 10:17.033
There's lots to talk about.

10:17.116 --> 10:18.534
Are you joking, asshole?

10:19.243 --> 10:21.078
Like I'm letting you fool me again.

10:21.162 --> 10:23.164
[uneasy music playing]

10:24.206 --> 10:25.458
You don't wanna find the girl?

10:36.552 --> 10:37.845
[music fades]

10:39.138 --> 10:40.306
[chains rattle]

10:40.389 --> 10:42.391
[stirring music playing]

11:35.277 --> 11:37.822
The doctor said
he will be down in a few minutes.

11:37.905 --> 11:39.240
Do you mind waiting down the hall?

11:39.323 --> 11:40.866
All right, I'll be waiting.

11:45.955 --> 11:47.665
[man on radio] I'm on my way down, over.

11:57.341 --> 11:59.552
Call for backup now.
The suspect disappeared.

12:01.345 --> 12:03.347
[dramatic music playing]

12:08.728 --> 12:11.021
INTENSIVE CARE UNIT

12:11.105 --> 12:13.023
- [sirens wailing]
- [indistinct radio chatter]

12:16.026 --> 12:18.028
[officer 1] Officers,
get inside as fast as you can!

12:18.112 --> 12:19.697
[whistle blowing]

12:37.465 --> 12:39.175
[nurse] Mr. Kwon Yong-gil's guardian?

12:39.258 --> 12:41.635
Please put on a mask
and sanitize your hands first.

12:42.136 --> 12:44.138
Because the patient is unconscious,

12:44.221 --> 12:45.723
you only have five minutes.

12:46.223 --> 12:47.808
Then please come right out.

12:47.892 --> 12:50.019
What happened? What do you mean he's gone?

12:50.102 --> 12:52.062
Hey, Forensics. Here. Have this looked at.

12:52.146 --> 12:55.441
[Ji-su] We have everyone,
including backup, searching the hospital.

12:55.524 --> 12:57.193
We'll find him as soon as we can.

12:58.277 --> 12:59.570
Son of a…

13:01.238 --> 13:03.240
[dramatic music continues]

13:14.460 --> 13:15.711
[Ho-jae] Yong-gil.

13:18.005 --> 13:19.089
Why did you do that?

13:22.051 --> 13:22.927
For what?

13:25.054 --> 13:26.972
I should at least know why you did it.

13:30.142 --> 13:30.976
[sighs]

13:32.603 --> 13:34.313
[officer 2] We received a call
from the ICU.

13:34.396 --> 13:37.316
Someone claimed to be Yong-gil's guardian
and asked to see him.

13:45.199 --> 13:47.576
- [music subsides]
- [Yong-gil breathes heavily]

13:47.660 --> 13:48.661
[weakly] Don't go.

13:48.744 --> 13:50.663
[monitor beeping]

13:50.746 --> 13:51.914
[wistful music playing]

13:51.997 --> 13:53.249
[Yong-gil] Don't go back.

13:55.459 --> 13:56.585
Don't go.

13:58.087 --> 13:59.588
[Ho-jae] How are you feeling?

13:59.672 --> 14:02.550
Can you hear me, hyung? It's me, Ho-jae.

14:03.133 --> 14:04.176
[Yong-gil] You can't

14:05.594 --> 14:06.554
go back.

14:06.637 --> 14:07.930
Don't go back.

14:10.808 --> 14:12.059
Just live as…

14:13.769 --> 14:14.854
as Ho-jae.

14:17.606 --> 14:18.691
Don't go.

14:34.248 --> 14:35.249
[Ji-su] Huh?

14:36.500 --> 14:37.793
Ah shit!

14:45.050 --> 14:47.052
[brooding music playing]

14:52.349 --> 14:53.809
[indistinct chattering]

14:57.187 --> 14:58.731
[breathing heavily]

14:58.814 --> 15:00.149
[unsettling music playing]

15:00.232 --> 15:02.026
[chains clattering]

15:15.456 --> 15:16.582
[loud clatter]

15:17.207 --> 15:18.208
[pants]

15:18.292 --> 15:20.252
[door clattering]

15:21.295 --> 15:22.922
[researcher] This is the brain scan.

15:23.589 --> 15:25.215
Let me zoom in for you.

15:25.883 --> 15:27.843
That way, you can get a better look.

15:38.896 --> 15:42.650
The way the Najin has embedded itself
is similar to that of Seung-jo's.

15:42.733 --> 15:45.152
Usually, when they
enter the body as larvae,

15:45.235 --> 15:47.446
they latch on nearer
to the top of the head.

15:47.529 --> 15:50.074
But these two have settled
in the back of the brain.

15:50.157 --> 15:53.702
Seung-jo received a mature Najin
from his biological mother.

15:53.786 --> 15:55.120
I think it's likely

15:56.205 --> 15:58.540
that she, too,
received hers in a similar way.

15:58.624 --> 16:00.626
[unsettling music continues]

16:07.716 --> 16:08.884
[door clatters]

16:08.968 --> 16:11.595
- [panting]
- [door clattering]

16:12.096 --> 16:13.472
[door clatters]

16:13.555 --> 16:14.974
[man] It's not gonna open.

16:16.558 --> 16:18.727
[chains rattling]

16:18.811 --> 16:19.687
[Chae-ok] Who's there?

16:20.896 --> 16:23.357
[breathing heavily]

16:23.440 --> 16:26.068
Do you know where we are
or what they want with us?

16:26.151 --> 16:29.113
[groaning]

16:29.905 --> 16:30.739
[retches]

16:30.823 --> 16:31.824
[sighs]

16:31.907 --> 16:32.741
[man retching]

16:32.825 --> 16:34.743
Are you all right? Look at me?

16:34.827 --> 16:37.371
[man breathing heavily]

16:40.416 --> 16:41.834
They all told me it would cure me.

16:45.212 --> 16:46.505
That if I drank it…

16:48.674 --> 16:50.592
then I wouldn't have
my disability anymore.

16:50.676 --> 16:51.677
That's what they said.

16:52.845 --> 16:54.013
[music fades]

16:54.096 --> 16:56.140
[researcher] The experiment is simple.

16:56.223 --> 16:59.977
Drink the water from the glass
that has been placed in front of you.

17:00.060 --> 17:02.604
Then you'll get a deposit
into your bank account.

17:03.272 --> 17:04.898
You will receive ten million won each.

17:04.982 --> 17:08.235
[test subjects exclaim]

17:10.738 --> 17:11.572
Uh, sir?

17:12.406 --> 17:13.240
Yes?

17:13.323 --> 17:15.409
If the experiment ends up working,

17:16.660 --> 17:18.871
does that mean
I will be able to use my leg again?

17:21.165 --> 17:23.792
[researcher] You have
post-polio syndrome, I see.

17:25.002 --> 17:25.961
You'll be cured.

17:27.129 --> 17:28.839
If the experiment ends up working,

17:30.090 --> 17:31.842
you'll no longer live with a disability.

17:34.053 --> 17:36.930
All right, everyone.
Let's drink up, shall we?

17:51.487 --> 17:52.529
[phone buzzes]

17:56.658 --> 17:58.285
10,000,000 WON RECEIVED
FROM AHN JONG-HYEOK

17:58.368 --> 18:00.120
Ten million won. [gasps]

18:02.414 --> 18:03.248
MY PUPPY

18:04.583 --> 18:07.461
[automated voice] The number
you are trying to reach is unavailable.

18:08.212 --> 18:10.631
Please leave your name
and message after the tone.

18:10.714 --> 18:11.548
[disconnect tone]

18:13.258 --> 18:15.803
[Jong-hyeok] I don't have to live
with a disability anymore.

18:16.887 --> 18:18.639
You don't have to suffer for me.

18:18.722 --> 18:20.724
- [screaming, crying]
- [clattering]

18:21.975 --> 18:23.685
[man 1] Help! Help me!

18:23.769 --> 18:25.771
[screaming, crying continues]

18:28.982 --> 18:30.651
[whimpers, sobs]

18:30.734 --> 18:32.528
[clattering]

18:33.987 --> 18:36.615
[woman] Please help me! Somebody help me!

18:36.698 --> 18:37.991
[sobbing]

18:38.075 --> 18:39.701
[screaming]

18:42.204 --> 18:44.039
[grunting]

18:44.123 --> 18:46.750
[crying]

18:49.503 --> 18:51.505
[gasping]

18:52.923 --> 18:55.843
[crying continues]

19:00.264 --> 19:02.099
They said if it was successful…

19:05.144 --> 19:06.979
that I would be able to walk again,

19:07.646 --> 19:10.399
that I'd be able to walk
like a normal person.

19:12.192 --> 19:15.070
[sobbing]

19:18.949 --> 19:20.951
[dramatic string music playing]

19:22.619 --> 19:24.621
[skin squelching]

19:25.622 --> 19:27.374
[retching]

19:32.921 --> 19:33.839
[chains rattle]

19:37.718 --> 19:39.428
[music subsides]

19:53.108 --> 19:55.068
[Ho-jae] When I was
in that accident last year,

19:55.152 --> 19:57.029
well, is there anything else you left out?

19:57.112 --> 20:00.490
I think you're much better off now
than you were before the accident.

20:00.574 --> 20:03.994
I'm here to see whether or not
you still have any of your old memories.

20:04.077 --> 20:05.412
[Chae-ok] Please. [sobs]

20:05.495 --> 20:06.705
Yoon Chae-ok.

20:06.788 --> 20:07.664
[Ho-jae sobs]

20:08.415 --> 20:10.417
[reverential music playing]

20:10.500 --> 20:11.501
[sighs]

20:29.770 --> 20:30.979
[sighs]

20:33.440 --> 20:34.441
[sighs]

20:37.236 --> 20:39.279
[wistful piano music playing]

21:43.218 --> 21:46.513
[high-pitched squeal]

21:48.390 --> 21:49.224
[groans]

21:51.393 --> 21:52.227
[groans]

21:52.769 --> 21:53.770
[Mrs. Nawol] Master Jang.

21:54.688 --> 21:56.606
[high-pitched squeal fades]

21:57.316 --> 21:59.318
[wistful piano music continues]

22:01.153 --> 22:02.404
[Mrs. Nawol] Master Jang.

22:13.582 --> 22:14.750
[Gap-pyeong] Hey, Master Jang.

22:16.251 --> 22:17.127
[groans]

22:18.378 --> 22:21.048
- [high-pitched squealing]
- [sentimental music playing]

22:28.472 --> 22:30.682
[Mrs. Nawol] Why are you
just standing there, Master Jang?

22:30.766 --> 22:32.184
Aren't you taking a photo with us?

22:42.069 --> 22:43.945
Ah! Goodness!

22:44.029 --> 22:45.864
The whole day is gonna go by. Hurry!

22:45.947 --> 22:48.116
[sentimental music continues]

22:55.874 --> 22:58.293
He says we gotta take the photo
while the light's still good.

22:58.377 --> 22:59.336
Stop messing around!

22:59.419 --> 23:03.173
You and I, we'll take
our own photo together afterwards.

23:03.256 --> 23:06.385
Listen, Yeong-chun, with that,
you can hire your own photographer.

23:06.468 --> 23:07.511
Do you understand?

23:07.594 --> 23:10.138
[all laughing]

23:10.722 --> 23:13.683
Goodness. Hurry, Master Jang.
Please get over here. Hurry.

23:14.559 --> 23:15.769
We're all waiting.

23:16.603 --> 23:18.313
[laughing]

23:18.397 --> 23:19.731
Come on, Master Jang!

23:19.815 --> 23:20.899
[chuckles]

23:23.318 --> 23:24.403
Let's go, hurry.

23:25.529 --> 23:27.531
[sentimental music continues]

24:11.324 --> 24:12.451
All right, I'm ready.

24:16.121 --> 24:18.123
[indistinct chattering]

24:18.206 --> 24:20.041
[photographer] Okay.
Everyone looking good.

24:20.125 --> 24:22.836
- Wait just a minute.
- [photographer] Sure thing. I'll wait.

24:24.129 --> 24:26.173
All right! Everyone, look here.

24:26.256 --> 24:27.466
One, two…

24:27.549 --> 24:28.508
[camera shutter clicks]

24:28.592 --> 24:30.427
One, two, three!

24:31.011 --> 24:31.928
[camera shutter clicks]

24:32.012 --> 24:33.180
[all laughing]

24:33.263 --> 24:36.349
[camera shutter clicking]

24:36.933 --> 24:38.768
I'm fine, really. Do I have to?

24:38.852 --> 24:40.312
We're celebrating, all right?

24:41.938 --> 24:43.482
A little closer. That's great.

24:43.565 --> 24:46.359
[Mrs. Nawol] Goodness, smile.
They won't arrest you for smiling.

24:46.443 --> 24:48.069
Oh, look at them both smiling.

24:48.153 --> 24:49.196
[all laughing]

24:49.279 --> 24:51.781
[photographer] Look here. One, two, three.

24:51.865 --> 24:53.033
[camera shutter clicks]

24:56.453 --> 24:58.455
[sentimental music continues]

25:15.430 --> 25:16.348
[sighs]

25:25.023 --> 25:26.775
[breathing heavily]

25:27.692 --> 25:29.694
[music fades]

25:33.740 --> 25:34.866
[sighs]

25:34.950 --> 25:36.034
Something to drink?

25:41.289 --> 25:43.583
[breathing heavily]

25:44.751 --> 25:46.753
[wistful music playing]

25:49.339 --> 25:50.423
[hollow knocking]

25:59.641 --> 26:00.559
[sighs]

26:04.771 --> 26:06.773
[crumbling]

26:22.622 --> 26:24.624
[wistful music continues]

26:26.751 --> 26:27.961
[brakes squeal]

28:47.100 --> 28:48.226
[music fades]

28:53.940 --> 28:54.899
[whooshes]

29:04.659 --> 29:06.661
[unsettling music playing]

29:08.955 --> 29:09.873
[whooshes]

29:10.540 --> 29:12.292
[grunts, groans]

29:17.422 --> 29:18.923
[breathing heavily]

29:19.799 --> 29:20.842
[Seung-jo] So weak.

29:21.551 --> 29:24.512
- [whooshing]
- [grunting]

29:30.477 --> 29:32.437
[Seung-jo] You're way too slow, Ho-jae.

29:34.814 --> 29:35.815
[Ho-jae grunts]

29:37.609 --> 29:40.945
[Seung-jo] How do you expect
to find the woman in this weak state?

29:41.029 --> 29:43.239
[Ho-jae breathing nervously]

29:45.825 --> 29:46.951
You asshole.

29:47.035 --> 29:48.912
Show yourself instead of hiding, huh?

29:49.454 --> 29:51.164
[Seung-jo] Does it look like I'm hiding?

29:53.458 --> 29:54.751
I'm right behind you.

29:55.835 --> 29:56.795
[Ho-jae grunts]

29:57.962 --> 29:58.963
[groans]

29:59.464 --> 30:01.508
[Seung-jo] Must be driving you crazy.

30:01.591 --> 30:03.635
I'm here, but you can't see me.

30:03.718 --> 30:05.345
And when you see me, you can't catch me.

30:05.428 --> 30:07.263
I've had enough of your bullshit.

30:07.347 --> 30:08.223
Come out.

30:08.765 --> 30:09.641
Come out.

30:10.391 --> 30:12.018
Show yourself, you bastard!

30:18.483 --> 30:19.317
Now you see me.

30:22.320 --> 30:23.196
Think you can beat me?

30:23.279 --> 30:24.823
[breathing heavily]

30:26.199 --> 30:27.283
[Ho-jae grunts]

30:28.827 --> 30:30.870
- [groans]
- You'll die at this rate.

30:34.499 --> 30:35.542
[groans]

30:36.125 --> 30:38.711
No one has ever messed
with our clan before.

30:40.338 --> 30:41.589
Except for one person.

30:41.673 --> 30:42.882
[groans]

30:43.633 --> 30:46.469
It was you.
Don't you want your powers back?

30:47.303 --> 30:48.930
Damn, you crazy bastard! [grunts]

30:55.478 --> 30:58.773
[Seung-jo] I think you know…
what I'm talking about.

30:58.857 --> 31:00.650
[groans]

31:00.733 --> 31:02.235
Your memories are returning.

31:03.236 --> 31:04.070
Aren't they?

31:05.280 --> 31:06.114
[slicing]

31:06.197 --> 31:08.199
[unsettling music continues]

31:27.510 --> 31:29.012
[groans]

31:29.679 --> 31:30.555
[grunts]

31:33.057 --> 31:34.767
[grunting]

31:38.021 --> 31:39.480
- Ah!
- [flesh tears]

31:49.824 --> 31:50.867
[moans]

31:57.081 --> 31:58.249
You once said to me…

31:58.333 --> 31:59.459
[Ho-jae moans]

31:59.542 --> 32:00.710
…"Don't run. Face it dead-on."

32:01.753 --> 32:03.087
"Look it right in the eye."

32:03.880 --> 32:06.007
"Only then
will you have a shot at winning."

32:08.176 --> 32:09.135
[Ho-jae whimpers]

32:10.637 --> 32:13.264
Do you remember
when you said that, Ho-jae?

32:13.348 --> 32:15.683
[labored breathing]

32:20.855 --> 32:22.065
You will soon enough.

32:25.193 --> 32:27.320
[tense music playing]

32:52.387 --> 32:54.013
[door clanking]

32:54.097 --> 32:55.682
[Chae-ok pants] Are you all right?

32:56.599 --> 32:57.475
Hey!

32:58.184 --> 32:59.811
Can you hear me? What's wrong?

33:00.478 --> 33:02.647
[Kuroko01] He'll stay like that
for a while.

33:04.065 --> 33:07.402
And if he wakes up, he won't be able
to recognize anyone at first.

33:07.485 --> 33:09.654
Instead, he'll have intense cravings.

33:13.992 --> 33:16.035
However, I'm sure you already know that.

33:17.620 --> 33:19.789
How long have you lived with a Najin?

33:20.581 --> 33:22.417
Why don't you tell me where I am first?

33:22.500 --> 33:24.210
As far as I'm aware…

33:26.337 --> 33:29.215
a Najin has never been leaked
to the outside by anyone here.

33:29.298 --> 33:31.134
What is this place used for?

33:32.802 --> 33:34.178
What kind of bastards are you

33:34.262 --> 33:36.472
that you would do something
as inhumane as this?

33:37.140 --> 33:38.558
How have you survived on your own?

33:41.060 --> 33:44.480
Tell me how it is that you have been able
to live with a Najin unsupervised,

33:44.564 --> 33:46.190
and are there more like you out there?

33:53.489 --> 33:54.741
This place isn't…

33:58.786 --> 34:00.329
Ongseong Hospital, is it?

34:07.253 --> 34:08.171
Is it?

34:10.048 --> 34:13.760
After the Greater East Asian War ended,
Ongseong Hospital closed down.

34:15.386 --> 34:17.096
Most of the building had been destroyed,

34:17.180 --> 34:19.891
but from its ruins,
a new company was erected.

34:19.974 --> 34:21.267
Jeonseung Bio.

34:25.063 --> 34:28.149
The company was founded by
Chairman Kato, together with Lady Maeda.

34:30.610 --> 34:34.113
And it's Kato's son, Shin Ji-oh,
who is the current chairman now.

34:37.742 --> 34:38.659
[sighs]

34:41.162 --> 34:44.248
[Chae-ok] So it… never ended, then?

34:45.583 --> 34:46.667
This hell.

34:48.086 --> 34:49.462
It's your turn to speak.

34:53.216 --> 34:54.467
So who are you?

35:07.480 --> 35:09.482
[dramatic music playing]

35:56.195 --> 35:57.196
[Kuroko04] Come out.

36:34.609 --> 36:36.027
[music subsides]

36:37.195 --> 36:38.112
[sighs]

36:39.655 --> 36:41.282
[brooding music playing]

37:00.134 --> 37:02.136
[Chae-ok breathing heavily]

37:20.738 --> 37:23.032
[footsteps approaching]

37:31.040 --> 37:33.042
[chains rattling]

38:28.639 --> 38:29.557
Your choice.

38:30.349 --> 38:32.393
Will you return to who you were before?

38:33.853 --> 38:34.812
Or will you…

38:37.523 --> 38:38.774
die here as you are?

38:41.152 --> 38:43.571
[Yong-gil] Don't go. Don't go back.

38:43.654 --> 38:44.822
[monitor beeping]

38:44.905 --> 38:46.240
Just live as

38:47.408 --> 38:48.701
as Ho-jae.

38:51.329 --> 38:52.496
Stay as Ho-jae.

38:54.582 --> 38:55.458
[gasps]

38:56.667 --> 38:57.960
I don't care if you're…

39:00.338 --> 39:01.297
Jang Tae-sang.

39:03.341 --> 39:04.550
Or if you are Jang Ho-Jae.

39:06.761 --> 39:08.888
Just return to the person I remember.

39:13.601 --> 39:15.436
For old times' sake, all right?

39:16.228 --> 39:17.063
Hmm?

39:31.285 --> 39:32.536
[door opens]

39:49.303 --> 39:51.764
[tense music playing]

40:06.862 --> 40:08.864
[music intensifies]

40:35.516 --> 40:36.851
[breathes nervously]

40:43.983 --> 40:45.443
It has been so long…

40:47.862 --> 40:49.238
Miss Yoon Chae-ok.

40:50.656 --> 40:52.658
[dramatic orchestral music playing]

42:18.911 --> 42:20.454
[music fades]

42:20.996 --> 42:23.457
["Forever" by Daniel Kim
of wave to earth playing]

42:34.260 --> 42:37.721
♪ Stuck in my head
I've been searchin' for the reason ♪

42:40.808 --> 42:42.518
♪ Nameless longing ♪

42:43.018 --> 42:45.646
♪ I've been waitin' for you for so long ♪

42:47.398 --> 42:51.735
♪ But got no direction
No matter I wanna reach you ♪

42:52.861 --> 42:56.156
♪ Another way you runnin'
Goin' on and on ♪

42:56.240 --> 42:58.409
♪ But need a way to get to you ♪

43:00.869 --> 43:02.871
♪ You ♪

43:03.664 --> 43:06.333
♪ You know I'm so stuck with you ♪

43:07.585 --> 43:09.628
♪ You ♪

43:10.337 --> 43:13.007
♪ Baby, I don't care at all ♪

43:13.507 --> 43:16.677
♪ You'll never know what I could do ♪

43:16.760 --> 43:19.680
♪ You'll never know
What we could have been ♪

43:19.763 --> 43:22.933
♪ For you
No, oh, oh, oh, oh-oh, oh ♪

43:23.017 --> 43:26.353
♪ Do you know, oh no ♪

43:26.437 --> 43:29.607
♪ All the way I found you here
Oh-oh, oh ♪

43:29.690 --> 43:32.860
♪ Oh I'll be right back for you
Oh no ♪

43:32.943 --> 43:35.154
[music fades]
